Advanced Navigation Packet Protocol Subsonus SDK Version 2.4
Utilities

******************
**** EXAMPLES ****
******************

Example Log:
	Contains a log file from Subsonus.
	
Matlab Log Import:
	Matlab code for importing Subsonus Recorder exported CSV into Matlab.

State Log Parser:
	C code for parsing Subsonus Recorder exported CSV state log file.
	
